# Random faults on the LED computer (P8d): how one is vetted, and what its Brief asks.
# The light on its way out, then again after a RESET.
machine led_computer
task "Watch the light, then press RESET."
press SW1:1000ms:1100ms
capture 200ms
capture 400ms
capture 600ms
capture 800ms
capture 1300ms
capture 1500ms
capture 1700ms
